  "ingredients": [
    "10 ounce halloumi cheese",
    "1 cup full-fat plain greek yogurt",
    "1/4 cup fresh mint (chopped)",
    "2 tablespoon olive oil",
    "1 teaspoon fresh garlic (finely chopped)",
    "salt and pepper (to taste)",
    "10 ounce mixed greens",
    "1 medium lemon"
  ],
  "instructions": [
    {
      "text": "Measure out and prepare all ingredients.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/halloumi-salad-with-mint-dressing/#wprm-recipe-53509-step-0-0",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2020/09/Halloumi-and-Mint-Dip-1.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a bowl, combine greek yogurt, fresh mint, fresh garlic, olive oil, and salt and pepper. Stir until combined well and set aside.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/halloumi-salad-with-mint-dressing/#wprm-recipe-53509-step-0-1",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2020/09/Halloumi-and-Mint-Dip-2.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Put the halloumi cheese into a nonstick frying pan without oil or butter. Fry on medium heat for 2-4 minutes. Apply pressure to the middle of the cheese before flipping to ensure the middle of the cheese is getting cooked.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/halloumi-salad-with-mint-dressing/#wprm-recipe-53509-step-0-2",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2020/09/Halloumi-and-Mint-Dip-3.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Flip the halloumi cheese over and do the same to this side until the cheese is golden brown in color. Remove from the frying pan carefully.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/halloumi-salad-with-mint-dressing/#wprm-recipe-53509-step-0-3",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2020/09/Halloumi-and-Mint-Dip-4.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Put mixed greens into a serving bowl and add the halloumi cheese on top. Squeeze the lemon on top and serve with the mint dressing.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/halloumi-salad-with-mint-dressing/#wprm-recipe-53509-step-0-4",
